You acknowledge that:
Completion of a consultation does not guarantee a prescription;
CBMPs will only be prescribed if clinically appropriate and lawful;
Follow-up consultations may be required as a condition of ongoing treatment;
Dispensed does not provide emergency medical services.
Clinicians retain sole discretion to determine eligibility for treatment and the appropriate formulation, dosage, and course of CBMPs.

You agree to:
Use CBMPs strictly in accordance with medical advice;
Attend required follow-up consultations;
Inform Dispensed of any changes in your health or concurrent medications;
Not obtain duplicate cannabis prescriptions from other providers concurrently;
Comply with UK driving laws relating to THC and operation of vehicles or machinery;
Refrain from misuse, diversion, or unauthorised sharing of prescribed medication.
